#: ../../source/changelog.rst:3 5f6480807f484d599ddbb7ad1fe7e87e
msgid "Changelog"
msgstr "更新日志"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:6 070f1227a1ea4388a9b664b01e5c56f7
msgid "2.0.3"
msgstr "2.0.3"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:8 05106c42dede403899dc731636afb156
msgid ""
"Fixes the `AKShare "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.ext.data.html#pybroker.ext.data.AKShare>`_"
" data source on ``akshare>=1.20.46``, which renamed ``stock_zh_a_hist`` "
"to ``stock_zh_a_hist_em`` and removed the old name. Older ``akshare`` "
"versions still work."
msgstr ""
"修复 `AKShare "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.ext.data.html#pybroker.ext.data.AKShare>`_"
" 数据源在 ``akshare>=1.20.46`` 上的问题。该版本将 ``stock_zh_a_hist`` 重命名为 "
"``stock_zh_a_hist_em``，并移除了旧名称。较早的 ``akshare`` 版本仍可正常使用。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:10 8e5da1b93a244bfc979a75a3b1b4a673
msgid ""
"Fixes the `Ulcer Index "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.eval.html#pybroker.eval.ulcer_index>`_"
" returning 0 when the values span exactly one ``period``."
msgstr ""
"修复 `溃疡指数 "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.eval.html#pybroker.eval.ulcer_index>`_"
" 在数值恰好跨越一个 ``period`` 时返回 0 的问题。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:12 29276034712247d785b229a0a0752685
msgid ""
"Speeds up the Sharpe Ratio bootstrap confidence intervals by 3.75x. "
"Results are bit-identical."
msgstr "夏普比率的自助法置信区间计算速度提升 3.75 倍，结果逐位一致。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:14 c55c401da5f14d99aee31b063856de9d
msgid ""
"Speeds up the backtest bar loop by 1.7x when all symbols share the same "
"trading calendar."
msgstr "当所有交易品种使用相同的交易日历时，回测的逐 K 线循环速度提升 1.7 倍。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:16 ca8c7431808d44e8ab386f1187169719
msgid ""
"Speeds up date slicing of the per-window data in `walkforward "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.walkforward>`_"
" by 1.3x."
msgstr ""
"`walkforward "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.walkforward>`_"
" 中按日期切分每个窗口数据的速度提升 1.3 倍。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:18 3fe7473f2d6a4201b029f98887b0cbf0
msgid ""
"Speeds up compressing base bars into 5-minute `intervals "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/notebooks/15.%20Multiple%20Time%20Intervals.html>`_"
" by 6.2x. Results are identical."
msgstr ""
"将基础 K 线压缩为 5 分钟 `时间区间 "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/notebooks/15.%20Multiple%20Time%20Intervals.html>`_"
" 的速度提升 6.2 倍，结果完全一致。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:21 8d59fe4e921847788b67a95f53166667
msgid "2.0.2"
msgstr "2.0.2"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:23 14317e96f59542ecaf7cb56d7c5b04c5
msgid ""
"Fixes a ``TypeError`` raised by every backtest on NumPy 1.x. PyBroker "
"supports ``numpy>=1.26.4``, but called ``np.asarray`` with ``copy=``, "
"which requires NumPy 2."
msgstr ""
"修复在 NumPy 1.x 上每次回测都会抛出 ``TypeError`` 的问题。PyBroker 支持 "
"``numpy>=1.26.4``，但调用 ``np.asarray`` 时传入了 ``copy=``，而该参数需要 NumPy 2。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:26 231ac2cbb8954eba8df27653121b81ad
msgid "2.0.1"
msgstr "2.0.1"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:28 249a3ab833f34e6f97842c218ee49963
msgid ""
"Adds ``use_log`` to the `returns "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.indicator.html#pybroker.indicator.returns>`_"
" indicator and `returnv "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.vect.html#pybroker.vect.returnv>`_"
" for computing log returns."
msgstr ""
"为 `returns "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.indicator.html#pybroker.indicator.returns>`_"
" 指标和 `returnv "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.vect.html#pybroker.vect.returnv>`_"
" 添加 ``use_log``，用于计算对数收益率。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:30 82123886acfc4b9ebd3c7c47b8db0f92
msgid ""
"Adds ``typing_extensions`` to install dependencies. It was already "
"imported by :mod:`pybroker.strategy` but never declared, so installs "
"relied on it being pulled in indirectly by another dependency."
msgstr ""
"将 ``typing_extensions`` 添加到安装依赖中。它此前已被 :mod:`pybroker.strategy` "
"导入，但从未声明为依赖项，因此安装时依赖于其他依赖项间接引入它。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:32 af8aeb9cd5db4c67b92a2b352fad9a76
msgid ""
"Requires ``optuna>=3.4``. Earlier versions store the sampler's random "
"generator in a different place, where `optimize "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.optimize>`_"
" could not re-seed it, so passing ``seed`` did not make the search "
"reproducible."
msgstr ""
"要求 ``optuna>=3.4``。更早的版本将采样器的随机数生成器存放在不同的位置，`optimize "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.optimize>`_"
" 无法对其重新播种，导致传入 ``seed`` 并不能使搜索结果可复现。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:34 cc61d4f582244601a9351fb30f13e8a0
msgid ""
"Fixes `parse_timeframe "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.common.html#pybroker.common.parse_timeframe>`_"
" to reject malformed timeframes instead of silently reading a valid token"
" out of them; ``\"1.5h\"`` was parsed as 5 hours and ``\"-1h\"`` as 1 "
"hour."
msgstr ""
"修复 `parse_timeframe "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.common.html#pybroker.common.parse_timeframe>`_，使其拒绝格式错误的时间周期，而不是从中悄悄读出一个有效的片段；此前"
" ``\"1.5h\"`` 会被解析为 5 小时，``\"-1h\"`` 会被解析为 1 小时。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:36 3a8d63d492854becbf2cc71fa698bfac
msgid ""
"Fixes the \"Finished training model\" log message, which raised a "
"``TypeError`` instead of reporting the elapsed training time."
msgstr "修复 “Finished training model” 日志消息，此前它会抛出 ``TypeError``，而不是报告训练耗时。"

